@startuml system-workflow-simple
title Solvay Spark Spine AI — Workflow at a glance (the eight flows)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam ArrowFontColor #333333
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF7E0
skinparam NoteBorderColor #E0C46C

actor "Analyst" as User
participant "FastAPI\n+ Guardrails" as API #E3F2FD
participant "Ingestion" as Ing #FFF3E0
participant "RAG system" as RAG #F3E5F5
database "PostgreSQL" as PG #ECEFF1
participant "Knowledge\ngraph" as KG #E8F5E9
database "Neo4j" as Neo #ECEFF1
participant "Ragas" as Ragas #E3F2FD
participant "Agents" as Agent #FFF3E0
participant "Hindsight" as Mem #F3E5F5
boundary "Claude" as Claude #ECEFF1
boundary "Langfuse" as LF #ECEFF1

== 1-3 — Upload, index, build the graph ==
User -> API : upload a document
API -> Ing : Docling → **Markdown**
API -> RAG : chunk + embed
RAG -> PG : vectors + full text
API -> KG : build from all Markdown + chunks
KG -> Neo : load a copy

== 4 — Ask RAG ==
User -> API : question
RAG -> PG : retrieve chunks
RAG -> Claude : chunks + question → **answer**
Ragas -> Claude : judge the answer
Ragas -> LF : quality scores

== 5 — Evidence Agent ==
User -> API : question
Agent -> Mem : recall
Agent -> RAG : search
Agent -> KG : traverse
Agent -> Claude : reason → **verified claims**

== 6-7 — InsightLens and Fit-Gap Copilot ==
User -> API : BPML scope · or a country As-Is
Agent -> RAG : search corpus / attachments
Agent -> KG : entities · BPML scope
Agent -> Claude : **fit-gap register · deviation register**
Agent -> PG : store run
Agent -> LF : trace

== 8 — Explore in Neo4j ==
User -> API : plain-English graph question
KG -> Claude : write **Cypher**
KG -> Neo : run read-only

note across
  Build order: Markdown → RAG index → graph → Neo4j. The agents are the only thing that reads both engines;
  Hindsight orients but never grounds. Full sequence: system-workflow.png.
end note

@enduml
